category: Libs
requires: cygwin libgcc1 libstdc++6
sdesc: "C++ library for application telemetry exposed as a virtual file tree (runtime)"
ldesc: "Telemetry is a C++ library for exposing application metrics,
counters and state as a tree of virtual directories and files, with aggregation
of values. The FUSE-based AppFs filesystem interface is not built."
external-source: telemetry

